'''Nahkriin''' is one of the eight high-ranked [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priests]] in Skyrim, and is encountered in [[Skyrim:Skuldafn|Skuldafn]], a temple you visit during [[Skyrim:The World-Eater's Eyrie|The World-Eater's Eyrie]].

Nahkriin, like the other seven dragon priests, has a [[Skyrim:Nahkriin (item)|mask]] with considerable power, as it gives 50 more magicka points and a 20% reduction on spell cost for [[SR:Destruction|Destruction]] and [[SR:Restoration|Restoration]] spells. 

Nahkriin wields a unique looking [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest Staff (Nahkriin)|staff]] with a powerful [[Skyrim:Wall of Storms|Wall of Storms]] attack. The staff must be used to open the portal to [[Skyrim:Sovngarde (place)|Sovngarde]].
